WEBVTT

00:00.240 --> 00:01.040
Prince of Jin's residence

00:01.120 --> 00:02.160
How is the situation?

00:02.240 --> 00:02.920
Prince of Jin's residence

00:03.000 --> 00:04.120
Safe for now

00:04.200 --> 00:05.000
But around it

00:05.080 --> 00:06.440
Many eyes are watching

00:08.080 --> 00:09.280
My sister and the heir

00:09.360 --> 00:11.027
Are both under house arrest
